  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_PokemonEasyToRead",
      "en_US": [
        "Dr. Footstep: Pokémon are quite easy\n",
        "for me to read.\r",
        "I need only to see their footprints,\n",
        "and their innermost thoughts are\f",
        "revealed to me!\r",
        "Oh?\n",
        "You are skeptical of my claim?\r",
        "Then, let your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} walk\n",
        "in front of me, right here.\r",
        "From its footprints, I will determine\n",
        "how it feels about you.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Dr Petitpas: Je n’ai aucun mal à\n",
        "identifier les Pokémon.\r",
        "Il me suffit d’observer leurs \n",
        "empreintes pour connaître leurs\f",
        "pensées les plus secrètes!\r",
        "Oh?\n",
        "Tu restes sceptique?\r",
        "Très bien, fais marcher ton \n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} devant moi.\r",
        "Je te dirai ce qu’il pense de toi en\n",
        "observant ses empreintes.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_CheckFeelingsAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Dr. Footstep: Do you want to check\n",
