        "{STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0}’s feelings, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\n",
        "understands!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0} et {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\n",
        "s’entendent à merveille.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} peut comprendre les\n",
        "sentiments de {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0}.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0} peut comprendre les\n",
        "sentiments de {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Cute_NoPrint_Level5",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} makes {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0}\n",
        "very proud!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} boasts to friends\n",
        "about {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} and {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0} are\n",
        "best of friends!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} emplit {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0}\n",
        "de fierté!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} se vante d’être avec\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} à tous ses amis!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} et {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0} sont\n",
        "les meilleurs amis du monde!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_WithPrint_Level1",
      "en_US": [
        "Why does {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} use only\n",
        "other Pokémon?\r",
        "Am I not needed much?\r",
        "Would I have been better off if\n",
        "I remained in the wild?\r",
        "No, I should give this Trainer\n",
        "a little more of a chance...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pourquoi {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} n’utilise\n",
        "que les autres Pokémon?\r",
        "Personne n’a besoin de moi?\r",
        "Est-ce que j’aurais mieux fait de\n",
        "rester vivre dans la nature?\r",
        "Non, je dois donner une seconde chance\n",
        "à ce Dresseur...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_WithPrint_Level2",
      "en_US": [
        "Humans can’t understand the cries\n",
        "of Pokémon, nor our feelings.\r",
        "However, there are some among us\n",
        "that understand human speech...\r",
        "Hehehe, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, you’re not bad\n",
        "for a human.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les humains ne comprennent pas les\n",
        "cris et les sentiments des Pokémon.\r",
        "Mais certains d’entre nous comprennent\n",
        "le langage humain...\r",
        "Héhéhé, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, tu n’es pas si\n",
        "mal pour un être humain.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_WithPrint_Level3",
      "en_US": [
        "If a Pokémon were to travel alone,\n",
        "it would be limited as to where\f",
        "it could go.\r",
        "But traveling with a human, a Pokémon\n",
        "would be able to travel farther afield\f",
        "to more distant cities and lands.\r",
        "Traveling with {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} has been\n",
        "rewarding and reassuring.\r",
        "And very entertaining...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Si un Pokémon devait voyager seul,\n",
        "ses choix de destination seraient\f",
        "limités.\r",
        "Mais en accompagnant un humain, un\n",
        "Pokémon peut rejoindre les villes et les\f",
        "régions les plus distantes.\r",
        "C’est rassurant et enrichissant\n",
        "de voyager avec {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Et c’est plutôt amusant...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_WithPrint_Level4",
      "en_US": [
        "Some wild Pokémon frown upon others\n",
        "for traveling with humans.\r",
        "They jeer that the caught Pokémon\n",
        "have “forgotten the wild.”\r",
        "But that view is mistaken.\r",
        "They have just never met a Trainer\n",
        "who could be a great partner.\r",
        "A great partner like {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0},\n",
        "in other words...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Certains Pokémon méprisent ceux qui\n",
        "voyagent avec des humains.\r",
        "Ils les raillent et prétendent qu’ils\n",
        "ont “oublié la nature”.\r",
        "Ils ont tort.\r",
        "Simplement, ils n’ont jamais rencontré\n",
        "de Dresseur qui leur convienne.\r",
        "En d’autres termes, un Dresseur\n",
        "comme {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_WithPrint_Level5",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} is...\n",
        "A remarkable human and Trainer.\r",
        "That I can always perform the best\n",
        "any {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} possibly can...\r",
        "I attribute that entirely to my\n",
        "partner {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "When we travel, I can see wild\n",
        "Pokémon eyeing us enviously...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} est... une personne\n",
        "et un Dresseur remarquable.\r",
        "Le fait que je sois un {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\n",
        "d’exception...\r",
        "Je le dois à {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} et à\n",
        "personne d’autre.\r",
        "Quand nous voyageons, les Pokémon\n",
        "sauvages nous épient avec envie...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_NoPrint_Level1",
      "en_US": [
        "Does {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} intend to ignore\n",
        "me forever?\r",
        "Give me more opportunities for me\n",
        "to shine...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} a vraiment l’intention de\n",
        "m’ignorer pour toujours?\r",
        "Donne-moi une chance de faire\n",
        "mes preuves...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_NoPrint_Level2",
      "en_US": [
        "If a Pokémon is treated as a friend,\n",
        "it will return the sentiments.\r",
        "We grow fonder of humans that treat\n",
        "us with kindness...\r",
        "Does {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} even like\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0}?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quand on traite un Pokémon en ami,\n",
        "il vous rend la pareille.\r",
        "Nous nous attachons aux humains qui\n",
        "nous traitent avec gentillesse...\r",
        "J’en viens à me demander si \n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} aime {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0}...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_NoPrint_Level3",
      "en_US": [
        "Did {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0} get stronger?\n",
        "Who is responsible for making me so?\r",
        "Is it {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s doing?\n",
        "Is the Trainer owed my thanks?\r"
