      "fr_FR": [
        "Est-ce que {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0} a progressé?\n",
        "C’est grâce à qui?\r",
        "Est-ce grâce à {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?\n",
        "Faut-il que je remercie mon Dresseur?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FootstepHouse_Text_Tough_NoPrint_Level4",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} and {STRVAR_1 1, 2, 0} are\n",
        "alike in some ways.\r",
        "In humanspeak, we match up well.\n",
        "Does {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} think so, too?\r"
